# Blocks that reach a definition along a longer route rather than by a
# direct import.  opentheory accepts each of these today, because every
# block on the route exports a theorem mentioning the symbol, but that is
# a property of what those articles happen to export rather than anything
# this file controls.  Settling one means adding the import named here.
reduce prim-rec
numeral prim-rec
numpair arithmetic
divides prim-rec
logroot marker
logroot prim-rec
gcd prim-rec
bit prim-rec
numeral-bit prim-rec
set-relation numeral
set-relation prim-rec
rich-list prim-rec
indexed-lists arithmetic
indexed-lists numeral
indexed-lists prim-rec
numposrep logroot
numposrep prim-rec
